"A crystal of {#} argon atoms at {#} K, under a piston pressing down with {#} atm. The heater in the floor adds heat at a steady rate. The temperature climbs, holds still while the crystal melts, climbs again, and holds still again while the liquid boils and the vapor pushes the piston up.",
